+      - name: Inject shadPS4 ARM64 + FEXCore runners into runtime bundle
+        # The v0.1.0 base bundle predates FEX/ARM64 support, so it carries
+        # only whatever ARM64 host glibc libs an earlier host tool needed.
+        # shadps4-arm64-fex / fexcore-smoke / fexcore-guest-harness pull in
